---
const updated = "22 March 2026";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Privacy policy — LayerBase</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --ink: #0f0e0d; --ink-2: #3d3b38; --ink-3: #7a7772;
      --paper: #faf9f7; --paper-2: #f0ede8; --paper-3: #e4e0d9;
      --accent: #3B5BDB; --navy: #1B2340;
      --serif: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
      --sans: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    }
    body { font-family: var(--sans); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; }
    nav {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); height: 64px;
      background: var(--paper); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-3);
    }
    .nav-logo { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--ink-2); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .page { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem) clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); }
    .page-label { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: .875rem; }
    .page-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.5rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    .page-updated { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-3); }
    .prose h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.375rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .875rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .prose p { font-size: .9875rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .prose ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .prose li { font-size: .9875rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: .375rem; }
    .prose a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    .prose a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .prose strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
    footer { background: var(--paper-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-3); padding: 2rem clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); margin-top: 4rem; }
    .footer-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .footer-links a { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--ink-3); text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .footer-copy { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Layer<span>Base</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="/templates">Templates</a></li>
    <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
    <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<div class="page">
  <p class="page-label">Legal</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="page-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>LayerBase is operated by Piecel Moussa, based in Strasbourg, France. We sell Notion templates and related services for digital businesses. You can contact us at <a href="mailto:piercel.coder2022@gmail.com">piercel.coder2022@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>What data we collect</h2>
    <p>We collect the following personal data when you interact with our website or services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email address and name</strong> — when you sign up for our newsletter, download a free resource, or purchase a template.</li>
      <li><strong>Purchase information</strong> — processed by Gumroad. We do not store payment card details. See <a href="https://gumroad.com/privacy" target="_blank">Gumroad's privacy policy</a> for details.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact form data</strong> — name, email, agency name, and message when you use our contact form.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage data</strong> — anonymised analytics data about how visitors use our site (pages visited, time on site). We use privacy-friendly analytics that do not set cookies or track across sites.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To deliver the products and resources you purchased or requested.</li>
      <li>To send our weekly newsletter if you subscribed. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email.</li>
      <li>To respond to contact form submissions.</li>
      <li>To improve our products and website based on aggregated, anonymised usage data.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

    <h2>Legal basis for processing (GDPR)</h2>
    <p>We process your data under the following legal bases:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contract</strong> — to fulfil product purchases and deliver what you paid for.</li>
      <li><strong>Legitimate interests</strong> — to respond to enquiries and improve our products.</li>
      <li><strong>Consent</strong> — for newsletter subscriptions. You can withdraw consent at any time.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your email address for as long as you remain subscribed to our newsletter. Purchase records are retained for 7 years as required by French tax law. Contact form submissions are deleted after 12 months.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under GDPR you have the right to access, correct, delete, or export your personal data. You also have the right to object to processing and to withdraw consent for email marketing at any time. To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:piercel.coder2022@gmail.com">piercel.coder2022@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Gumroad</strong> — payment processing and template delivery. <a href="https://gumroad.com/privacy" target="_blank">Privacy policy →</a></li>
      <li><strong>Brevo (Sendinblue)</strong> — email newsletter delivery. Data stored in EU. <a href="https://www.brevo.com/legal/privacypolicy/" target="_blank">Privacy policy →</a></li>
      <li><strong>Netlify</strong> — website hosting and form submissions. <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank">Privacy policy →</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>Our website does not use tracking cookies. We use privacy-friendly analytics that do not require cookies and do not track you across other websites.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last updated. Continued use of our website after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy-related questions, email <a href="mailto:piercel.coder2022@gmail.com">piercel.coder2022@gmail.com</a>. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the CNIL (Commission Nationale de l'Informatique et des Libertés) if you believe your data rights have been violated.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <ul class="footer-links">
      <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
      <li><a href="/terms">Terms</a></li>
      <li><a href="/refunds">Refunds</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 LayerBase</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>